          "path": "_m/9/y/y/j/kemper-military-school-wp/abandoned-science-supply-area-.jpg",
          "filename": "Abandoned Science Supply Area - Old Kemper Military School - Boonville, MO (5087328857).jpg",
          "caption": "Interesting to note some stuff still sits untouched on the shelves, even after 8 years of abandonment.  Vandals have been in here, but nothing much has been touched.\n\nPictures from the long abandonded Kemper Military School in Boonville, MO.  The school shut down in 2002 and the grounds have sent empty since.  The city of Boonville owns the property and the fields are used for soccer games and other activities, but the buildings sit falling down and apart.  Mother nature and vandals have taken their toll over the years.  Pictures are from the fall of 2010.",
